  <p id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-wang-family:army" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-wang-family:army:m0000" ref="39o_b6y_n74">敦</persName>遣其兄<persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-wang-family:army:m0004" ref="mwc_md4_l0g">含</persName>及<persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-wang-family:army:m0006" ref="762_5c8_663">錢鳳</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-wang-family:army:m0009" ref="smf_swf_i2l">周撫</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-wang-family:army:m0012" ref="cws_842_o4u">鄧岳</persName>等水陸五萬，至于南岸。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-wang-family:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-wang-family:death:m0000" ref="39o_b6y_n74">王敦</persName>憤惋而死。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-wang-family:sui" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">平北將軍、徐州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-006-jin098-wang-family:sui:m0009" ref="i4e_4wq_2qc">王邃</persName>，</p>
